- make W=1 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/: OK, 0 warnings.
- apple-dcp run.sh: 50 ok; the same 6 pre-existing not-ok as on d60121ff (clang 23);
  publication-hpd ok. dcp14-panel-tests.py: pass.
- edid-decode on the new block: "Gamma: 2.20", "Model year: 2023". The remaining failure is
